      "content": "it just feels like there's no way back. like, how am i supposed to explain this to my advisor? or my parents? the shame is just too much. i feel like i've already failed everyone. i can't see a future where i'm not just a walking embarrassment. it's like the person i was supposed to be died with that data.",
